text SS0009 "\n## For agents\n\n- [llms.txt](https://www.aienos.com/llms.txt): the site for AI readers.\n- [llms-full.txt](https://www.aienos.com/llms-full.txt): every English page in full.\n- [AGENTS.md](https://www.aienos.com/AGENTS.md): how to build and change this site.\n- [data/index.json](https://www.aienos.com/data/index.json): machine-readable files, schemas and cadence.\n"
